{"id":"Mo0nlQxI","slug":"svc-for-lunar-client","title":"SVC for Lunar Client","description":"A light-weight modpack to jump straight into a world with friends, using Simple Voice Chat, on Lunar Client.","author":"LunarClient","categories":["fabric","lightweight","multiplayer","optimization"],"display_categories":["lightweight","multiplayer","optimization"],"client_side":"unknown","server_side":"unknown","project_type":"modpack","downloads":834453,"followers":52,"license":{"id":"MIT","name":"MIT License"},"loaders":["fabric"],"game_versions":["1.21.4","1.21.6","1.21.7","1.21.8","1.21.10","1.21.11","26.1.2","26.2","26.3"],"latest_version":"qoQUxPAZ","date_created":"2025-01-22T09:41:42.929793Z","date_modified":"2026-09-26T08:13:53.878920Z","updated":"2026-09-26T08:13:53.878920Z","color":2368548,"body":"# SVC for Lunar Client\n\n**SVC for Lunar Client** is a lightweight modpack that allows you to use Simple Voice Chat on Lunar Client.\n\n_Note: We recommend using [**Lunar Client**](https://lunarclient.com/download) to gain the best experience while using this modpack, however it can be launched on any modpack loader._\n\n## Modpack Content\n\n* **Simple Voice Chat**: A working voice chat in Minecraft.\n* **Sodium**: Modern rendering engine which greatly improves performance.\n* **Iris**: Modern shaders mod for Minecraft, compatible with OptiFine shader packs.\n* **Fabric API**: Adds common hooks and intercompatibility measures.\n* **Mod Menu**: Adds a mod menu to view an in-game list of all the mods you have installed.\n\n## FAQ\n\n<details>\n<summary>How do I install the SVC modpack on Lunar Client?</summary>\n\n<center><b>Here are the five easy steps you need to take!</b></center>\n\n### Step 1: Download Lunar Client\n[![Lunar Client Download Grid](/launcher-preview/bodies/Mo0nlQxI/0.webp)](https://www.lunarclient.com/download)\n\n### Step 2: Select \"Versions\" on the Lunar Client Launcher\n[![Lunar Client Launcher](/launcher-preview/bodies/Mo0nlQxI/1.webp)](https://www.lunarclient.com/news/mod-loading-on-lunar-client)\n\n### Step 3: Click \"Modpacks\" on the top of the page\n[![Lunar Client Modpacks](/launcher-preview/bodies/Mo0nlQxI/2.webp)](https://www.lunarclient.com/news/mod-loading-on-lunar-client)\n\n### Step 4: Install your modpack of choosing, in this case the SVC for Lunar Client Modpack.\n[Lunar Client Modpack Installer](https://www.lunarclient.com/news/mod-loading-on-lunar-client)\n\n### Step 5: Click \"Launch Game\" after the install is complete!\n[Lunar Client Launch Button](https://www.lunarclient.com/news/mod-loading-on-lunar-client)\n\n</details>\n\n<br>\n\nConnect with fellow SVC enthusiasts and stay in the loop with latest updates in our [Discord](https://lunarclient.com/discord).","published":"2025-01-22T09:41:42.929793Z","additional_categories":[],"issues_url":null,"source_url":null,"wiki_url":null,"discord_url":null,"donation_urls":[],"team":[{"username":"LunarClient","role":"Owner","avatar":"/launcher-preview/avatars/LunarClient.webp"}],"versions_total":10,"gallery":[{"url":"/launcher-preview/galleries/Mo0nlQxI/0.webp","featured":true,"title":"SVC for Lunar Client","description":null,"created":"2025-01-22T10:08:40.618089Z"},{"url":"/launcher-preview/galleries/Mo0nlQxI/1.webp","featured":false,"title":"In-game Voice Chat","description":"In-game voice chat with your friends while playing!","created":"2025-01-22T10:11:42.422464Z"}],"versions":[{"id":"qoQUxPAZ","name":"SVC for Lunar Client 0.1.0","version_number":"0.1.0","version_type":"release","game_versions":["26.3"],"loaders":["fabric"],"featured":false,"date_published":"2026-09-26T08:13:53.878920Z","downloads":38866,"changelog":"","dependencies":[{"project_id":"AANobbMI","version_id":"bAZQdGpg","dependency_type":"embedded","file_name":null},{"project_id":"YL57xq9U","version_id":"bAdKrpw8","dependency_type":"embedded","file_name":null},{"project_id":"P7dR8mSH","version_id":"bNnaTiuM","dependency_type":"embedded","file_name":null},{"project_id":"eXts2L7r",